{"id":"70d7a97bd7315c54","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-leray-hopf-data.md","title":"Leray–Hopf 弱解的测试函数与能量数据","display":"df-leray-hopf-data — Leray–Hopf 弱解的测试函数与能量数据","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-leray-hopf-data","aliases":["58-df-leray-hopf-data"],"display":"df-leray-hopf-data — Leray–Hopf 弱解的测试函数与能量数据","depends_on":["[[../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-test-function.md]]","[[58-df-distribution.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-weak-derivative.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-leray-hopf-data"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-leray-hopf-data</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-leray-hopf-data — Leray–Hopf 弱解的测试函数与能量数据"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5111035a66b30703\" href=\"?note=5111035a66b30703\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md\">../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" href=\"?note=76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md\">../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a1d034d5d39b4a14\" href=\"?note=a1d034d5d39b4a14\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"458fd0dccec3665f\" href=\"?note=458fd0dccec3665f\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-test-function.md\">../batch06/58-df-test-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c53fe47de39217ed\" href=\"?note=c53fe47de39217ed\" title=\"58-df-distribution.md\">58-df-distribution.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"03ca577eb4c1b05e\" href=\"?note=03ca577eb4c1b05e\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-weak-derivative.md\">../batch08/58-df-weak-derivative.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,\\nu\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\">\\(T,\\nu\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\)</span>；所有实、复数运算及有限向量运算使用标准结构。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_n,\\mathcal B_n,\\lambda_n\">\\(\\tau_n,\\mathcal B_n,\\lambda_n\\)</span> 为 <code>58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data</code> 的欧氏 Borel 数据；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal B_n\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal B_n\\)</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_A,\\lambda_A\">\\(\\mathcal B_A,\\lambda_A\\)</span> 是限制数据。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D(\\Omega)\">\\(\\mathcal D(\\Omega)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D&#39;_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega)\">\\(\\mathcal D&#39;_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega)\\)</span> 使用 <code>58-df-test-function</code>、<code>58-df-distribution</code>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_j\\phi\">\\(D_j\\phi\\)</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 坐标的一阶导数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_j\\in\\omega^3\">\\(e_j\\in\\omega^3\\)</span> 取第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 坐标为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>、其余为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I_A\">\\(\\mathcal I_A\\)</span> 是下式定义的实积分部分函数，仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal I_A)\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal I_A)\\)</span> 上取值。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\int_A f\\,d\\lambda_A\">\\(\\int_A f\\,d\\lambda_A\\)</span> 在本文件只对可测非负函数使用；有符号积分使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I_A\">\\(\\mathcal I_A\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_\\sigma\">\\(H_\\sigma\\)</span> 是下式给出的向量值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^2\">\\(L^2\\)</span> 商类载体；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_0\\in H_\\sigma\">\\(u_0\\in H_\\sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 的载体是时间到该商类空间的函数图，而不是任意逐点重选的弱解代表。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rep}_{58}(F,h)\">\\(\\operatorname{Rep}_{58}(F,h)\\)</span> 指定一个三分量实代表。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota(t,x)\\in\\mathbb R^4\">\\(\\iota(t,x)\\in\\mathbb R^4\\)</span> 取坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle t,x(0),x(1),x(2)\\rangle\">\\(\\langle t,x(0),x(1),x(2)\\rangle\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_T=\\{y\\in\\mathbb R^4:0\\le y(0)\\le T\\}\">\\(J_T=\\{y\\in\\mathbb R^4:0\\le y(0)\\le T\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_T=\\{y\\in\\mathbb R^4:0&lt;y(0)&lt;T\\}\">\\(\\Omega_T=\\{y\\in\\mathbb R^4:0&lt;y(0)&lt;T\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_{t,i}(x)=U(\\iota(t,x))(i)\">\\(U_{t,i}(x)=U(\\iota(t,x))(i)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_{t,ij}(x)=G(\\iota(t,x))(i,j)\">\\(G_{t,ij}(x)=G(\\iota(t,x))(i,j)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_i(y)=U(y)(i)\">\\(U_i(y)=U(y)(i)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_{ij}(y)=G(y)(i,j)\">\\(G_{ij}(y)=G(y)(i,j)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}\">\\(\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\">\\(\\ell\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_1,\\lambda_1\">\\(\\mathcal B_1,\\lambda_1\\)</span> 沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\mapsto\\langle t\\rangle\">\\(t\\mapsto\\langle t\\rangle\\)</span> 的拉回；它们不是新选的时间测度。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R^{3\\times3}}\">\\(\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R^{3\\times3}}\\)</span> 同样沿固定词典序坐标双射到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R^9\">\\(\\mathbb R^9\\)</span> 拉回。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DivergenceFreeL2}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(h;X)\">\\(\\operatorname{DivergenceFreeL2}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(h;X)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LerayHopfSolution}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(u,p;u_0,\\nu,T)\">\\(\\operatorname{LerayHopfSolution}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(u,p;u_0,\\nu,T)\\)</span> 保留被调用的二元、五元接口；本文件的前者只针对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=\\mathbb R^3\">\\(X=\\mathbb R^3\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal I_A&amp;:=\\{\\langle f,r\\rangle:f\\in\\mathbb R^A\\land r\\in\\mathbb R\\land\n\\operatorname{SignedIntegralValue}_S(r,f,A,\\mathcal B_A,\\lambda_A)\\},\\\\\nL^2_{\\mathbb R}&amp;:=\\{c\\in L^2(\\mathbb R^3,\\mathcal B_3,\\lambda_3):c\\cap\\mathbb R^{\\mathbb R^3}\\ne\\varnothing\\},\\qquad H:=(L^2_{\\mathbb R})^3,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Rep}_{58}(F,h)&amp;\\leftrightarrow h\\in H\\land F\\in(\\mathbb R^{\\mathbb R^3})^3\n\\land\\forall i\\in3\\;F(i)\\in h(i),\\\\\n\\Gamma(F,\\phi)&amp;:=\\{\\langle x,\\sum_{i\\in3}F(i)(x)D_i\\phi(x)\\rangle:x\\in\\mathbb R^3\\},\\\\\nH_\\sigma&amp;:=\\{h\\in H:\\forall F\\;(\\operatorname{Rep}_{58}(F,h)\\to\n\\forall\\phi\\in\\mathcal D(\\mathbb R^3)\\;[\\Gamma(F,\\phi)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal I_{\\mathbb R^3})\n\\land\\mathcal I_{\\mathbb R^3}(\\Gamma(F,\\phi))=0])\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{DivergenceFreeL2}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(h;X)&amp;\\leftrightarrow X=\\mathbb R^3\\land h\\in H_\\sigma.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal I_A&amp;:=\\{\\langle f,r\\rangle:f\\in\\mathbb R^A\\land r\\in\\mathbb R\\land\n\\operatorname{SignedIntegralValue}_S(r,f,A,\\mathcal B_A,\\lambda_A)\\},\\\\\nL^2_{\\mathbb R}&amp;:=\\{c\\in L^2(\\mathbb R^3,\\mathcal B_3,\\lambda_3):c\\cap\\mathbb R^{\\mathbb R^3}\\ne\\varnothing\\},\\qquad H:=(L^2_{\\mathbb R})^3,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Rep}_{58}(F,h)&amp;\\leftrightarrow h\\in H\\land F\\in(\\mathbb R^{\\mathbb R^3})^3\n\\land\\forall i\\in3\\;F(i)\\in h(i),\\\\\n\\Gamma(F,\\phi)&amp;:=\\{\\langle x,\\sum_{i\\in3}F(i)(x)D_i\\phi(x)\\rangle:x\\in\\mathbb R^3\\},\\\\\nH_\\sigma&amp;:=\\{h\\in H:\\forall F\\;(\\operatorname{Rep}_{58}(F,h)\\to\n\\forall\\phi\\in\\mathcal D(\\mathbb R^3)\\;[\\Gamma(F,\\phi)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal I_{\\mathbb R^3})\n\\land\\mathcal I_{\\mathbb R^3}(\\Gamma(F,\\phi))=0])\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{DivergenceFreeL2}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(h;X)&amp;\\leftrightarrow X=\\mathbb R^3\\land h\\in H_\\sigma.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\langle\\ ,\\ \\rangle_H:=\\{\\langle\\langle h,k\\rangle,r\\rangle:{}&amp;h,k\\in H\\land r\\in\\mathbb R\\land\n\\exists F,G\\;[\\operatorname{Rep}_{58}(F,h)\\land\\operatorname{Rep}_{58}(G,k)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\{\\langle x,\\sum_{i\\in3}F(i)(x)G(i)(x)\\rangle:x\\in\\mathbb R^3\\}\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal I_{\\mathbb R^3})\\\\\n&amp;\\land r=\\mathcal I_{\\mathbb R^3}(\\{\\langle x,\\sum_{i\\in3}F(i)(x)G(i)(x)\\rangle:x\\in\\mathbb R^3\\})]\\},\\\\\nN(h)&amp;:=\\sqrt{\\langle h,h\\rangle_H}\\quad(h\\in H),\\\\\n\\operatorname{WeakL2Continuous}_{58}(u,T)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;u\\in H_\\sigma^{[0,T]}\\land\n\\forall v\\in H\\;\\forall t\\in[0,T]\\;\\forall\\varepsilon&gt;0\\;\\exists\\delta&gt;0\\;\\forall s\\in[0,T]\\\\\n&amp;\\bigl(|s-t|&lt;\\delta\\to|\\langle u(s),v\\rangle_H-\\langle u(t),v\\rangle_H|&lt;\\varepsilon\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\langle\\ ,\\ \\rangle_H:=\\{\\langle\\langle h,k\\rangle,r\\rangle:{}&amp;h,k\\in H\\land r\\in\\mathbb R\\land\n\\exists F,G\\;[\\operatorname{Rep}_{58}(F,h)\\land\\operatorname{Rep}_{58}(G,k)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\{\\langle x,\\sum_{i\\in3}F(i)(x)G(i)(x)\\rangle:x\\in\\mathbb R^3\\}\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal I_{\\mathbb R^3})\\\\\n&amp;\\land r=\\mathcal I_{\\mathbb R^3}(\\{\\langle x,\\sum_{i\\in3}F(i)(x)G(i)(x)\\rangle:x\\in\\mathbb R^3\\})]\\},\\\\\nN(h)&amp;:=\\sqrt{\\langle h,h\\rangle_H}\\quad(h\\in H),\\\\\n\\operatorname{WeakL2Continuous}_{58}(u,T)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;u\\in H_\\sigma^{[0,T]}\\land\n\\forall v\\in H\\;\\forall t\\in[0,T]\\;\\forall\\varepsilon&gt;0\\;\\exists\\delta&gt;0\\;\\forall s\\in[0,T]\\\\\n&amp;\\bigl(|s-t|&lt;\\delta\\to|\\langle u(s),v\\rangle_H-\\langle u(t),v\\rangle_H|&lt;\\varepsilon\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{EnergyRepresentative}_{58}(U,G,u,T)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nU\\in(\\mathbb R^3)^{J_T}\\land G\\in(\\mathbb R^{3\\times3})^{\\Omega_T}\n\\land u\\in H_\\sigma^{[0,T]}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Measurable}_S(U;(J_T,\\mathcal B_{J_T}),(\\mathbb R^3,\\mathcal B_3))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Measurable}_S(G;(\\Omega_T,\\mathcal B_{\\Omega_T}),(\\mathbb R^{3\\times3},\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R^{3\\times3}}))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl[\\forall t\\in[0,T]\\;\\forall i\\in3\\quad U_{t,i}\\in u(t)(i)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl[\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;\\forall t\\in[0,T]\\quad N(u(t))\\le C\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\int_{\\Omega_T}\\sum_{i,j\\in3}|G_{ij}|^2\\,d\\lambda_{\\Omega_T}&lt;\\infty\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists A\\in\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}\\;[A\\subseteq(0,T)\\land\\ell((0,T)\\setminus A)=0\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall t\\in A\\;\\forall i,j\\in3\\;(\n\\operatorname{WeakDerivative}_S(G_{t,ij},U_{t,i},e_j,\\mathbb R^3,3)\n\\land\\int_{\\mathbb R^3}|G_{t,ij}|^2\\,d\\lambda_3&lt;\\infty)].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{EnergyRepresentative}_{58}(U,G,u,T)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nU\\in(\\mathbb R^3)^{J_T}\\land G\\in(\\mathbb R^{3\\times3})^{\\Omega_T}\n\\land u\\in H_\\sigma^{[0,T]}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Measurable}_S(U;(J_T,\\mathcal B_{J_T}),(\\mathbb R^3,\\mathcal B_3))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Measurable}_S(G;(\\Omega_T,\\mathcal B_{\\Omega_T}),(\\mathbb R^{3\\times3},\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R^{3\\times3}}))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl[\\forall t\\in[0,T]\\;\\forall i\\in3\\quad U_{t,i}\\in u(t)(i)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl[\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;\\forall t\\in[0,T]\\quad N(u(t))\\le C\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\int_{\\Omega_T}\\sum_{i,j\\in3}|G_{ij}|^2\\,d\\lambda_{\\Omega_T}&lt;\\infty\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists A\\in\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}\\;[A\\subseteq(0,T)\\land\\ell((0,T)\\setminus A)=0\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall t\\in A\\;\\forall i,j\\in3\\;(\n\\operatorname{WeakDerivative}_S(G_{t,ij},U_{t,i},e_j,\\mathbb R^3,3)\n\\land\\int_{\\mathbb R^3}|G_{t,ij}|^2\\,d\\lambda_3&lt;\\infty)].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nJ_G(s,t)&amp;:=\\int_{\\{y\\in\\Omega_T:s&lt;y(0)&lt;t\\}}\\sum_{i,j\\in3}|G_{ij}(y)|^2\\,d\\lambda_4(y)\n\\quad(0\\le s\\le t\\le T),\\\\\n\\Psi_{i,\\phi}^{U,G,\\nu}&amp;:=\\Bigl\\{\\Bigl\\langle y,\nU_i(y)D_0\\phi(y)+\\sum_{j\\in3}U_i(y)U_j(y)D_{j+1}\\phi(y)\n-\\nu\\sum_{j\\in3}G_{ij}(y)D_{j+1}\\phi(y)\\Bigr\\rangle:y\\in\\Omega_T\\Bigr\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{WeakNS}_{58}(U,G,p,\\nu,T)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\np\\in\\mathcal D&#39;_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega_T)\\land\n\\bigl[\\forall\\phi\\in\\mathcal D(\\Omega_T)\\quad p(\\phi)\\in\\mathbb R\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in3\\;\\forall\\phi\\in\\mathcal D(\\Omega_T)\\;[\n\\Psi_{i,\\phi}^{U,G,\\nu}\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal I_{\\Omega_T})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathcal I_{\\Omega_T}(\\Psi_{i,\\phi}^{U,G,\\nu})+p(D_{i+1}\\phi)=0].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nJ_G(s,t)&amp;:=\\int_{\\{y\\in\\Omega_T:s&lt;y(0)&lt;t\\}}\\sum_{i,j\\in3}|G_{ij}(y)|^2\\,d\\lambda_4(y)\n\\quad(0\\le s\\le t\\le T),\\\\\n\\Psi_{i,\\phi}^{U,G,\\nu}&amp;:=\\Bigl\\{\\Bigl\\langle y,\nU_i(y)D_0\\phi(y)+\\sum_{j\\in3}U_i(y)U_j(y)D_{j+1}\\phi(y)\n-\\nu\\sum_{j\\in3}G_{ij}(y)D_{j+1}\\phi(y)\\Bigr\\rangle:y\\in\\Omega_T\\Bigr\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{WeakNS}_{58}(U,G,p,\\nu,T)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\np\\in\\mathcal D&#39;_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega_T)\\land\n\\bigl[\\forall\\phi\\in\\mathcal D(\\Omega_T)\\quad p(\\phi)\\in\\mathbb R\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in3\\;\\forall\\phi\\in\\mathcal D(\\Omega_T)\\;[\n\\Psi_{i,\\phi}^{U,G,\\nu}\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal I_{\\Omega_T})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathcal I_{\\Omega_T}(\\Psi_{i,\\phi}^{U,G,\\nu})+p(D_{i+1}\\phi)=0].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}leray\\text{-}hopf\\text{-}solution}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\quad\n\\operatorname{LerayHopfSolution}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(u,p;u_0,\\nu,T)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nT,\\nu\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\land u_0\\in H_\\sigma\n\\land\\operatorname{WeakL2Continuous}_{58}(u,T)\\land u(0)=u_0\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists U,G,A\\;[\\operatorname{EnergyRepresentative}_{58}(U,G,u,T)\n\\land\\operatorname{WeakNS}_{58}(U,G,p,\\nu,T)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land A\\in\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}\\land A\\subseteq(0,T)\\land\\ell((0,T)\\setminus A)=0\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall s\\in\\{0\\}\\cup A\\;\\forall t\\in[s,T]\\quad\nN(u(t))^2+2\\nu J_G(s,t)\\le N(u(s))^2].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}leray\\text{-}hopf\\text{-}solution}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\quad\n\\operatorname{LerayHopfSolution}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(u,p;u_0,\\nu,T)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nT,\\nu\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\land u_0\\in H_\\sigma\n\\land\\operatorname{WeakL2Continuous}_{58}(u,T)\\land u(0)=u_0\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists U,G,A\\;[\\operatorname{EnergyRepresentative}_{58}(U,G,u,T)\n\\land\\operatorname{WeakNS}_{58}(U,G,p,\\nu,T)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land A\\in\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}\\land A\\subseteq(0,T)\\land\\ell((0,T)\\setminus A)=0\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall s\\in\\{0\\}\\cup A\\;\\forall t\\in[s,T]\\quad\nN(u(t))^2+2\\nu J_G(s,t)\\le N(u(s))^2].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>用商类固定各时刻的速度，用联合 Borel 代表表达空间弱导数和时空分布方程。代表不作为新的公开参数；更换几乎处处相等的代表不改变定义。</li>\n<li>能量不等式的起始时刻是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 及一个共同满测度时刻集，终止时刻取其后的所有时刻。未把能量不等式误写成仅对几乎所有终止时刻成立。</li>\n<li>这里只展开原文件已有的弱解条件；不附加速度的经典可微性、唯一性或局部能量不等式。实压力由复分布在实测试函数上取实值得到。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Leray, Sur le mouvement d’un liquide visqueux emplissant l’espace (1934).</li>\n<li>Hopf, Über die Anfangswertaufgabe für die hydrodynamischen Grundgleichungen (1951).</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"5111035a66b30703","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"76a1ed4ae7e8b05d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"a1d034d5d39b4a14","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-test-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"458fd0dccec3665f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-test-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-distribution.md","status":"resolved","id":"c53fe47de39217ed","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-distribution.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-weak-derivative.md","status":"resolved","id":"03ca577eb4c1b05e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-weak-derivative.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,\\nu\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_n,\\mathcal B_n,\\lambda_n","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal B_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_A,\\lambda_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D(\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D'_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"D_j\\phi","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"e_j\\in\\omega^3","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal I_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal I_A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\int_A f\\,d\\lambda_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal I_A","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"H_\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"L^2","display":false},{"tex":"u_0\\in H_\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Rep}_{58}(F,h)","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota(t,x)\\in\\mathbb R^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle t,x(0),x(1),x(2)\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"J_T=\\{y\\in\\mathbb R^4:0\\le y(0)\\le T\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega_T=\\{y\\in\\mathbb R^4:0<y(0)<T\\}","display":false},{"tex":"U_{t,i}(x)=U(\\iota(t,x))(i)","display":false},{"tex":"G_{t,ij}(x)=G(\\iota(t,x))(i,j)","display":false},{"tex":"U_i(y)=U(y)(i)","display":false},{"tex":"G_{ij}(y)=G(y)(i,j)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_1,\\lambda_1","display":false},{"tex":"t\\mapsto\\langle t\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R^{3\\times3}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R^9","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DivergenceFreeL2}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(h;X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LerayHopfSolution}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(u,p;u_0,\\nu,T)","display":false},{"tex":"X=\\mathbb R^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal I_A&:=\\{\\langle f,r\\rangle:f\\in\\mathbb R^A\\land r\\in\\mathbb R\\land\n\\operatorname{SignedIntegralValue}_S(r,f,A,\\mathcal B_A,\\lambda_A)\\},\\\\\nL^2_{\\mathbb R}&:=\\{c\\in L^2(\\mathbb R^3,\\mathcal B_3,\\lambda_3):c\\cap\\mathbb R^{\\mathbb R^3}\\ne\\varnothing\\},\\qquad H:=(L^2_{\\mathbb R})^3,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Rep}_{58}(F,h)&\\leftrightarrow h\\in H\\land F\\in(\\mathbb R^{\\mathbb R^3})^3\n\\land\\forall i\\in3\\;F(i)\\in h(i),\\\\\n\\Gamma(F,\\phi)&:=\\{\\langle x,\\sum_{i\\in3}F(i)(x)D_i\\phi(x)\\rangle:x\\in\\mathbb R^3\\},\\\\\nH_\\sigma&:=\\{h\\in H:\\forall F\\;(\\operatorname{Rep}_{58}(F,h)\\to\n\\forall\\phi\\in\\mathcal D(\\mathbb R^3)\\;[\\Gamma(F,\\phi)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal I_{\\mathbb R^3})\n\\land\\mathcal I_{\\mathbb R^3}(\\Gamma(F,\\phi))=0])\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{DivergenceFreeL2}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(h;X)&\\leftrightarrow X=\\mathbb R^3\\land h\\in H_\\sigma.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\langle\\ ,\\ \\rangle_H:=\\{\\langle\\langle h,k\\rangle,r\\rangle:{}&h,k\\in H\\land r\\in\\mathbb R\\land\n\\exists F,G\\;[\\operatorname{Rep}_{58}(F,h)\\land\\operatorname{Rep}_{58}(G,k)\\\\\n&\\land\\{\\langle x,\\sum_{i\\in3}F(i)(x)G(i)(x)\\rangle:x\\in\\mathbb R^3\\}\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal I_{\\mathbb R^3})\\\\\n&\\land r=\\mathcal I_{\\mathbb R^3}(\\{\\langle x,\\sum_{i\\in3}F(i)(x)G(i)(x)\\rangle:x\\in\\mathbb R^3\\})]\\},\\\\\nN(h)&:=\\sqrt{\\langle h,h\\rangle_H}\\quad(h\\in H),\\\\\n\\operatorname{WeakL2Continuous}_{58}(u,T)\\leftrightarrow{}&u\\in H_\\sigma^{[0,T]}\\land\n\\forall v\\in H\\;\\forall t\\in[0,T]\\;\\forall\\varepsilon>0\\;\\exists\\delta>0\\;\\forall s\\in[0,T]\\\\\n&\\bigl(|s-t|<\\delta\\to|\\langle u(s),v\\rangle_H-\\langle u(t),v\\rangle_H|<\\varepsilon\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{EnergyRepresentative}_{58}(U,G,u,T)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nU\\in(\\mathbb R^3)^{J_T}\\land G\\in(\\mathbb R^{3\\times3})^{\\Omega_T}\n\\land u\\in H_\\sigma^{[0,T]}\\\\\n&\\land\\operatorname{Measurable}_S(U;(J_T,\\mathcal B_{J_T}),(\\mathbb R^3,\\mathcal B_3))\\\\\n&\\land\\operatorname{Measurable}_S(G;(\\Omega_T,\\mathcal B_{\\Omega_T}),(\\mathbb R^{3\\times3},\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R^{3\\times3}}))\\\\\n&\\land\\bigl[\\forall t\\in[0,T]\\;\\forall i\\in3\\quad U_{t,i}\\in u(t)(i)\\bigr]\\\\\n&\\land\\bigl[\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;\\forall t\\in[0,T]\\quad N(u(t))\\le C\\bigr]\\\\\n&\\land\\int_{\\Omega_T}\\sum_{i,j\\in3}|G_{ij}|^2\\,d\\lambda_{\\Omega_T}<\\infty\\\\\n&\\land\\exists A\\in\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}\\;[A\\subseteq(0,T)\\land\\ell((0,T)\\setminus A)=0\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall t\\in A\\;\\forall i,j\\in3\\;(\n\\operatorname{WeakDerivative}_S(G_{t,ij},U_{t,i},e_j,\\mathbb R^3,3)\n\\land\\int_{\\mathbb R^3}|G_{t,ij}|^2\\,d\\lambda_3<\\infty)].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nJ_G(s,t)&:=\\int_{\\{y\\in\\Omega_T:s<y(0)<t\\}}\\sum_{i,j\\in3}|G_{ij}(y)|^2\\,d\\lambda_4(y)\n\\quad(0\\le s\\le t\\le T),\\\\\n\\Psi_{i,\\phi}^{U,G,\\nu}&:=\\Bigl\\{\\Bigl\\langle y,\nU_i(y)D_0\\phi(y)+\\sum_{j\\in3}U_i(y)U_j(y)D_{j+1}\\phi(y)\n-\\nu\\sum_{j\\in3}G_{ij}(y)D_{j+1}\\phi(y)\\Bigr\\rangle:y\\in\\Omega_T\\Bigr\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{WeakNS}_{58}(U,G,p,\\nu,T)\\leftrightarrow{}&\np\\in\\mathcal D'_{\\mathbb C}(\\Omega_T)\\land\n\\bigl[\\forall\\phi\\in\\mathcal D(\\Omega_T)\\quad p(\\phi)\\in\\mathbb R\\bigr]\\\\\n&\\land\\forall i\\in3\\;\\forall\\phi\\in\\mathcal D(\\Omega_T)\\;[\n\\Psi_{i,\\phi}^{U,G,\\nu}\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal I_{\\Omega_T})\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathcal I_{\\Omega_T}(\\Psi_{i,\\phi}^{U,G,\\nu})+p(D_{i+1}\\phi)=0].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}leray\\text{-}hopf\\text{-}solution}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\quad\n\\operatorname{LerayHopfSolution}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(u,p;u_0,\\nu,T)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nT,\\nu\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\land u_0\\in H_\\sigma\n\\land\\operatorname{WeakL2Continuous}_{58}(u,T)\\land u(0)=u_0\\\\\n&\\land\\exists U,G,A\\;[\\operatorname{EnergyRepresentative}_{58}(U,G,u,T)\n\\land\\operatorname{WeakNS}_{58}(U,G,p,\\nu,T)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land A\\in\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}\\land A\\subseteq(0,T)\\land\\ell((0,T)\\setminus A)=0\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall s\\in\\{0\\}\\cup A\\;\\forall t\\in[s,T]\\quad\nN(u(t))^2+2\\nu J_G(s,t)\\le N(u(s))^2].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"0","display":false}],"bytes":6902,"backlinks":[{"id":"4cb76a48eeccf0fc","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{DivergenceFreeL2}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(u_0;\\mathbb R^3)$ 与 $\\operatorname{LerayHopfSolution}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(u,p;u_0,\\nu,T)$ 使用 [[58-df-leray-hopf-data.md]] 中已展开的二元、五元关系。"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-770","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-leray-hopf-data.md|58-df-leray-hopf-data]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["5111035a66b30703","76a1ed4ae7e8b05d","a1d034d5d39b4a14","458fd0dccec3665f","c53fe47de39217ed","03ca577eb4c1b05e"]}